seg-e6d8549f24b9 = Partner data: what measured data could promote a MODELLED row

# text
seg-7b9ff34db2c4 = Kshana labels every capability in a machine-checked ledger (<a1>verification matrix</a1>). Most timing and sensor rows are <b>MODELLED</b>: they rest on stated models, published datasheets and internal checks, and no measured record of the device class has been compared with them. A holder of such a record can change that. This page says which rows, what to send, how a submission is checked, how it is scored and how it is credited. It is written for a laboratory, a manufacturer or a university group; it is not an offer of work and it claims no endorsement by anyone. Advisory only: Kshana is a study instrument, not type-approved navigation or timing equipment.

# text
